<title>USA: Champion Parts Inc Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Champion Parts Inc Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended	 Fourth Quarter Ended</p>
<p>		   Dec. 29,    Dec. 31,    Dec. 29,	Dec. 31,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net Sales  $27,560,000 $52,950,000   $6,800,000   $6,600,000</p>
<p>Net Loss</p>
<p>		(1,467,000)(18,840,000)    (480,000)  (4,950,000)</p>
